      "content": "i was just thinking about everything and honestly... it feels like there's no point. like if you look at the math of it, all the effort to stay alive just cancels itself out in the end. if nothing actually matters in the long run, then staying or not staying is basically the same thing, right? it's just a neutral choice.",
